WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From all fours, bring the right knee toward the right wrist, shin angled across.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Extend the left leg straight back, top of the foot on the floor.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Square the hips and support the front hip with a prop if needed.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Stay upright or fold forward over the front shin. Switch sides.
